# find_csv_in_matched_folders.py

## 配置区
`ROOT_SEARCH_PATH` / `FOLDER_PATTERN` / `MOVE_DIR`|`COPY_DIR`  
`RUN_SENSITIVITY` / `SENSITIVITY_OUT_CSV` / `PAK_NUM` / `SENS_ACCURACY`

## 功能
- 路径解析 → band, phymode(phymd), 20m, ldpc, he …
- 灵敏度（wifiRxPlot 算法）→ `sensitivity_summary_*.csv`
- 可选 copy/move、list-out TSV

## 运行
```bash
python find_csv_in_matched_folders.py
python find_csv_in_matched_folders.py --sensitivity-out D:\out\sens.csv
```

## 文档
`skill/find_csv_in_matched_folders_Skill.md`
